# "If you control an artifact" (CR 603.4): Bot1's Black Lotus is sacrificed for the mana, so Bot1 controls no artifact as the Pirates
# enters (it is a creature, not an artifact) and the ability does not trigger: nothing goes on the stack and no target is asked, though Bot2's
# Ornithopter would be a legal target. The Ornithopter is left untapped with no counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Waylaying Pirates
Island x4
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Waylaying Pirates.Cast
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Target
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Waylaying Pirates
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = false
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.Stun = (absent)
